; Export the agent control entries under their UNDECORATED names so the controller
; resolves them by a fixed string on both arches. They are __stdcall (WINAPI) remote
; thread routines, so on x86 the real symbols are _probe_agent_init@4 etc.; MSVC maps
; these bare .def names onto the decorated symbols. The callbacks keep their own
; __declspec exports (resolved by table lookup, so their decoration is self-consistent).
EXPORTS
    probe_agent_init
    probe_agent_stop
